{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-19T09:02:12.858Z","data":{"text":"Task 4 is complete. Summary:\n\n## Implementation\n\n**`src/core/parser.ts`** — `SpecData` gained `readonly verify: string`; `parseSpecMd` extracts and trims `data.verify`.\n\n**`src/core/linter.ts`** — `lintChangeFolder` rejects a resolved `proposal.md` with an empty `verify` (`proposal.md must declare a verify command in frontmatter`). Legacy `spec.md` stays exempt per the delta scenario wording.\n\n**`src/watcher/archiver.ts`** (245 lines, under budget) — `checkAndArchiveSpec` now re-runs every task `verify` in numeric order, then the proposal's change-level `verify`, through the existing `runVerificationGate` (shared timeout, detached TTY-free spawn). Any failure writes `.run/regressed/<n>.md` / `regressed/change.md` (command, exit code, output) and a typed `regressed` event with `exitCode`/`duration`, then blocks archiving. Only when all pass does it call `archiveSpecFolder`.\n\n**Tests**\n- `tests/linter.test.ts`: proposal missing `verify` rejected; valid `verify` accepted.\n- `tests/archive-verification.test.ts` (new): parser extraction + three end-to-end scenarios (clean archive, pre-spawn scope regression, change-level verify failure) driven by the real `AgyAdapter` against an executable fake harness script — no `MockAdapter`.\n\n## Necessary collateral (documented in result)\nThe linter rule flows through `approveSpec`, so keeping the suite green required out-of-scope edits: a `verify` placeholder in `templates/proposal.md` and `new.ts`'s fallback, the same line in four inline proposal fixtures, and regenerated golden event fixtures (template line count shifted `repoLines`/`proposalWords`).\n\n## Verification\n- Task verify: `node --import tsx --test tests/archive-verification.test.ts` — 4/4 pass.\n- `pnpm tsc --noEmit` clean · `pnpm test` 610 pass / 1 skipped / 0 fail · `pnpm lint` clean.\n- Result written to `.run/results/4.md`."}}
